      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated and welcoming clinic team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients speak warmly of the veterinary practitioners and staff, commending Dr. Todd, Dr. Gabby, Michelle, and Christina for treating families with genuine kindness. Longtime pet owners appreciate the clinic's longstanding heritage and note that the personnel treat their dogs with empathy and patience during every visit."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how comfortably anxious, elderly, and special-needs dogs are handled by the veterinary team. Pet owners highlight that staff members take time to soothe fearful animals, providing nail trims, diagnostic exams, and end-of-life care with great tenderness, ensuring pets feel safe."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 3,
      "title": {
        "en": "Proactive and clear clinical communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients commend the practice for prompt and thorough updates regarding pet treatments. Reviewers particularly praise Dr. Todd for calling pet owners directly with progress reports and appreciate that veterinary doctors explain diagnoses and procedure options in accessible, reassuring language."
      }
    }
  ],
